                    "id": "engineering",
                    "topic": "engineering",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "同源写入检查、哈希围栏、垃圾箱放在Skill根外均值得借鉴，避免watcher误发现删除项。维护代价是跨宿主设置API和配置方言，以及非事务目录/lock更新；复用时应明确恢复边界。 源码依据：[src/routes.ts](https://github.com/6pofx/dsh-tool-explorer/blob/63ea4c8192f715c3157af69e71fef67915db8af1/src/routes.ts)、[src/mcp.ts](https://github.com/6pofx/dsh-tool-explorer/blob/63ea4c8192f715c3157af69e71fef67915db8af1/src/mcp.ts)、[src/skills-install.ts](https://github.com/6pofx/dsh-tool-explorer/blob/63ea4c8192f715c3157af69e71fef67915db8af1/src/skills-install.ts)、[src/skills-trash.ts](https://github.com/6pofx/dsh-tool-explorer/blob/63ea4c8192f715c3157af69e71fef67915db8af1/src/skills-trash.ts)、[src/patch-text.ts](https://github.com/6pofx/dsh-tool-explorer/blob/63ea4c8192f715c3157af69e71fef67915db8af1/src/patch-text.ts)。",
